# No trailing slash: `cache/` matches only a directory, so when a worktree
# symlinked `cache` at the main checkout's tile store, the SYMLINK was not
# ignored and got committed. Checking that branch out in the main worktree
# then pointed the link at itself and git deleted 44,357 downloaded tiles to
# make room for it. Match the name, not just the directory.
cache
data/candidates.jsonl
!data/candidates.jsonl.gz
data/colours.jsonl
!data/colours.jsonl.gz
# Stage 4/5 intermediates. Both rebuild from the tiles in seconds, and the
# site consumes data/grid.bin from stage 6, not these.
data/palette.jsonl
data/families.json
data/atlas.json
qc_*.png
*.pyc
__pycache__/
